Third-party code in this folder. Each file keeps its upstream license, MIT for all of them:

  khash.h, kseq.h, ksort.h, rh_kvec.h (kvec.h), ketopt.h
      klib, https://github.com/attractivechaos/klib (the license below; khash.h, kseq.h, ksort.h and rh_kvec.h also
      carry it in the file)
  kalloc.c, kalloc.h, kthread.c, kthread.h, bseq.c, bseq.h
      minimap2, https://github.com/lh3/minimap2 (the license below)
  hdf5_tools.hpp
      Matei David, Ontario Institute for Cancer Research (the license is in the file)

RawHash2 and onsight changed some of them (for example, renamed symbols).

